Silverman's (1984) approximation of generalised cross-validation (Craven and Wahba 1979),
\deqn{\mathrm{GCV}(\lambda) = \frac{T^{-1}\sum_{t}(x_t - \hat{g}_t(\lambda))^2}{\left(1 -
